iMask 2.4

High-refresh, PiP, background audio and coexistence implementation adapted from:
Original project: https://github.com/CaiWanFeng/PiP
Original author: CaiWanFeng
Current project: https://github.com/Yoroin/GlobalRefresh-PiP
Maintainer: Yoroin
Reference commit: 1b62341c1d62308962fb3656192d6783631aa00c

The original PiP controller and supporting implementation are retained under
Vendor/GlobalRefresh. iMask replaces the home UI hosting seam, adds an interface
adapter, and uses its own app identity for shortcut routing. The 2.1 UI and
ActivityKit feature are maintained by iMask.

Please retain attribution to CaiWanFeng and Yoroin and the corresponding links
when modifying or distributing software based on these projects.

